As part of the performance marketing team at VML, the &nbsp; Connections &nbsp; Manager acts as the operational engine for campaign execution, optimization, and structural excellence across social and display platforms. We are looking for a disciplined, highly organized professional who demonstrates a strong command of media platforms and audience segmentation. You will work closely with the &nbsp; Connections &nbsp; Supervisor to execute cross-channel strategies, ensuring budgets are paced accurately, creative assets are trafficked properly, and performance consistently meets client goals.&nbsp;

PRIMARY RESPONSIBILITIES &nbsp;

• Campaign Execution &amp; Trafficking:  Execute the setup and launch of campaigns across Meta, Google Ads (specifically Display), and other social platforms (e.g., TikTok, LinkedIn, X). This includes configuring audience targeting, uploading creatives, and ensuring brand safety parameters are met.&nbsp;

• Budget Management (Pacing):  Lead the daily monitoring of media spend across multiple platforms and campaigns to ensure adherence to monthly and quarterly budgets.&nbsp;

• Platform Operations &amp; Optimization:  Manage the day-to-day mechanics of the accounts, including placement performance reviews, bid management, and implementing optimization changes to scale campaigns efficiently.&nbsp;

• QA &amp; Compliance:  Conduct rigorous quality assurance checks on live ads to ensure landing pages are functional and creative specs are correct before and during launch.&nbsp;

DESIRED SKILLS/EXPERIENCE &nbsp;

• 2+ Years Digital Trafficking Experience:  Proven hands-on experience managing, trafficking, and executing campaigns primarily on Meta and Google Ads (Display network), along with other social media platforms.&nbsp;

